# PROJECT: Smart Traffic Congestion Detection and Alternative Route Recommendation System

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, Firebase architect, and deployment engineer.

Build a complete, functional, responsive, full-stack web application called:

**Smart Traffic — Traffic Congestion Detection and Alternative Route Recommendation System**

This project is for a Semester V college IDEAL Lab project under the theme of Urban Mobility and Sustainable Cities.

The application should solve urban transportation problems by helping users monitor road congestion, report traffic conditions, compare routes, and discover alternative travel routes.

IMPORTANT: Do not create only a static UI or a frontend mockup. Build a working application with real navigation, functional forms, Firebase integration, interactive maps, route calculations, error handling, and deployment configuration.

Do not leave buttons nonfunctional or use fake API responses while claiming they are live.

