2. APPLICATION PURPOSE
==================================================

The system helps commuters understand traffic conditions in urban areas and compare alternative routes.

Users should be able to:

1. View an interactive city map.
2. Explore reported road congestion.
3. Search for a starting location and destination.
4. Calculate alternative driving routes.
5. Compare route distances and estimated travel times.
6. Submit traffic-condition reports.
7. View recent traffic reports.
8. Identify roads reported as congested.
9. Save favorite routes when logged in.
10. View statistics and charts about reported congestion.

The default demonstration region should be Mira-Bhayandar, Maharashtra, India.

Allow users to search for other locations as well.

